    "chunk_text": "leorningcnihtum \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde faran to Hierusalem & fela \u00feinga & \u00fea genam Petrus hyne onsundron & cw\u00e6\u00f0 to him, Drihten, ne gewur\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t. \u00dea beseah he hyne & cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Petre, gang b\u00e6ftan me Satanas; Wi\u00feerr\u00e6de \u00feu eart me for\u00feam \u00feu nast \u00dea s\u00e6de se H\u00e6lend hys leorningcnihtum, gyf hwa wylle fyligean me, wi\u00fesace hyne sylfne & nyme So\u00felice se \u00fee wyle hys sawle hale gedon he hig forspil\u00fe, & se \u00fee wyle hig for me forspyllan se hig Hw\u00e6t frema\u00f0 \u00e6negum menn \u00feeah he ealne middaneard gestryne gyf he hys sawle forwyrd \u00feola\u00f0, Witodlice mannes sunu ys to cumenne on hys F\u00e6der wuldre mid hys englum & \u00feonne agylt So\u00f0lice ic secge eow sume synt her standende \u00fee dea\u00fe ne onbyrigea\u00f0 \u00e6r hig geseon mannes sunu & \u00e6fter six dagum nam se H\u00e6lend Petrum & Iacobum & Iohannem hys bro\u00feor & l\u00e6dde hig & he w\u00e6s gehiwod beforan him & his ansyn scean swa swa sunne & hys reaf w\u00e6ron swa hwite swa & efne \u00fea \u00e6tywde Moyses & Helias mid him sprecende. \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 Petrus to him, Drihten, god ys us her to beonne; Gyf \u00feu wylt uton wyrcean her \u00fereo Him \u00fea gyt sprecendum & so\u00felice \u00fea beorhtwolcn hig oferscean & \u00fea efne com stefn of \u00feam wolcne & \u00fea hig \u00feis gehyrdon hys leorningcniht",
